    {
      "text": "%md\n### Parsing issue\n- To inspect the parsing issue, we can display entire rows instead of letting SerDe to process each line into columns.\n- Create an external table `wdi_gs_debug` with one column without any SerDe parsing\n- Query the line that have parsing issue `WHERE line like \"%\\(\\% of urban population\\)\\\"%\"`",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2025-06-27T18:06:41+0000",
      "progress": 0,
