            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Parsing issue</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>To inspect the parsing issue, we can display entire rows instead of letting SerDe to process each line into columns.</li>\n<li>Create an external table <code>wdi_gs_debug</code> with one column without any SerDe parsing</li>\n<li>Query the line that have parsing issue <code>WHERE line like &quot;%\\(\\% of urban population\\)\\&quot;%&quot;</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"
          }
        ]
